---
title: "A plugin change from PR to every config folder"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: pr
    lg1: rollout
    lg2: current
    lg3: stale
    lg4: Breaks DocStepsReachEveryFolder
    lg5: Path to the DocStepsReachEveryFolder bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No PR open
  s1: PR open
  s2: Checks pass
  s3: Merged, no folder updated
  s4: Merged, some folders updated
  s5: README steps done, another Claude Code folder stale
  s6: Every folder on the merged commit
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a PR edits a plugin
  s1 --> s2: the checks pass
  s2 --> s3: the PR merges
  s3 --> s4: you install the merged SHA in the Hermes profile or you run them again under another CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR or you run the README update steps
  s4 --> s5: you run the README update steps or you install the merged SHA in the Hermes profile
  s4 --> s6: you run the README update steps or you install the merged SHA in the Hermes profile
  s5 --> s6: you run them again under another CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 yellow
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 yellow
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s5 breaks
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
